    "question": "One student on a field trip counted 12 squirrels. Another counted a third more squirrels than the first student. How many squirrels did both students count combined?",
    "gold": "28",
    "answer": "The second student counted 12/3 = 4 more squirrels than the first student.\nThe second student counted 12+4 = <<12+4=16>>16 squirrels.\nTogether, the first and second student counted 12+16 = <<12+16=28>>28 squirrels combined.\n#### 28"
